Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:45.74,Default,,550,0,550,,{\i1\b1}A \NModest \N Rebellion{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:56.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:03:01.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is this the factory that still produces androids?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:03.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's smaller than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Androids committing mass suicide...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:11.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something the media would want to know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:13.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll give you ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While I am questioning the person in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:18.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You go and check inside the production line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:21.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:24.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course! I'm a pro you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:32.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get the factory owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take that to the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:50.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am Aramaki from Public Safety Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:58.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I came here to question you about the\Nandroids you created that committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:01.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Abe, the factory owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:04.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry to have caused such trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:09.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It seems that all of them were of the same type.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Yes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Type GA07-JL.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:17.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It's the type that was known as "Jerry" to users.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:20.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It sold well when it first came out,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:23.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}but only 8.000 or so are still active nationwide.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:28.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Frankly, it's not our top seller anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:31.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We only manufacture parts\Nfor maintenance purposes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm listening, I'll look it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The design is old now and its\Nmovement and speech are awkward,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so we're not sure how much longer\Nwe'll continue making the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:47.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have any idea why the\Nmachine type Jerry was targeted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I think I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:57.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Jerry was the type that a lot\Nof users modified improperly.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:03.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Our superiors were actually happy and said\Nto let it be if that makes the thing sell.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:08.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}The young workers from our\Nfactory are creeped out because{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.27,0:05:12.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}they think the Jerrys cursed\Ntheir fate and committed suicide.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:14.55,Default,,0,0,120,,{\i1}Warning: Virus detected!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:21.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please help us find out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:22.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:25.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's no doubt that it was caused by a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Someone snuck it into the\Nperiodic examination program...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:44.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and infected every user's Jerry\Nthat connected via the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:50.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,One of the Jerrys that was sent back\Nto the factory for a repair examination
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:54.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,contained a time-based virus that\Ninfected the factory's program.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:57.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm having Ishikawa analyse\Nthe inside just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it's a public user's crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:03.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you think it's unrelated\Nto the case at the Capitol?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:08.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But we still need to confirm it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:11.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I got a hold of the list of Jerry users.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Start with those who have a higher priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Send the list to Batou and Pazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.49,0:06:19.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll head for the first house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.39,0:06:26.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, return to Section\N9 and wait for orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, but its seems there's\Nno role for you in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:37.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to what I've heard I get\Na present if I stay home, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:42.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In that case, after I get back I'll tell you all the\Nexciting details of what happened until you get sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Exciting details?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:46.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:50.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it's starting to ask for presents now, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:57.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:57.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Yes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:00.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I'm done analysing the virus.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:06.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It's a virus that was made by an amateur, it's very\Ndifferent from the virus that was found in the Capitol.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:07.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:11.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}One thing that worried me is\Nthat I found a protection code.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,120,,{\i1}Warning: Virus detected!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:14.00,Default,,120,0,105,,{\i1}This program is protected.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:18.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it was made to protect the creator's machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:23.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That means there's a high probability\Nthat the culprit has a normal Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:24.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Most likely.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:28.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the factory owner's story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It seems he was telling the truth.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:36.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They stopped manufacturing the\Ntype 07-JL three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:42.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I have confirmed multiple complaints from\Nhardcore users who opposed stopping production.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:47.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Send that info to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:49.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You did well for the short amount of time given.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:55.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I got complimented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:08.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did the police find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I changed locations multiple times, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't live without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:29.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:32.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you be with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.73,0:08:34.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go to Italy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are we going to do there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll think about it after we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sadness is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would choose nothing instead of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:13.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A weird case of androids simultaneously\Ncommitting suicide has been reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today we have Mr. Miyashiro,\Na modern sociologist, here as our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:23.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,First of all Mr Miyashiro,\Nwhat do you think about this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:27.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Androids are not life forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:30.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so it's not "suicide".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:33.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We should call it "self-destruction".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:40.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There're rumours that the robots are starting\Nto gain Ghosts like in certain old SF comics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:46.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It could be that this crime is done for\Nthe pleasure of making people believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:47.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:49.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Really, I see...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Concentrate on the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Jerry was fairly popular in those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:10:00.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Its performance wasn't\Nspectacular, but it was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:03.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I haven't seen any lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:08.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't see them around, it\Nmeans our investigation will be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:11.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And because of this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:14.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the already small number of\Nmachines will become even smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:18.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But why are we handling this kind of case?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:20.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We should have let the police handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you forget about that robot-related incident\Nthat happened last month at the Capitol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:27.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That robot was also made by Genesis Andross.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:34.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I remember that, but this case and\Nthat case are almost unrelated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:37.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have to investigate a link that\Nwill most likely be non-existent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, you want to say, "this isn't our job"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:44.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is what they mean by "Preparing\Nfor the one in 10.000 chance."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:49.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It means the other 9999 instances will be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:53.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We still don't know where the virus originated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:59.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's start investigating\Nfrom the top of the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:02.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's get this job done quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:03.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Being a public officers is just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're rough as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can open it without breaking\Nit if you let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You take too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:35.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This guy must be a movie freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,120,,{\i1}Warning. Virus detected!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.41,0:13:00.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:03.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's the virus that was planted in the Jerrys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We hit the right spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:14.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:16.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We found the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:19.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's pretty cunning, we were a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:22.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will send you our current\Nlocation and the info we collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now we have to wait for Ishikawa's info.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:31.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come on, spill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:37.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't record where the sex doll androids go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop it. This place isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have confirmed the culprit's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:54.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's the son of the Canadian\Nambassador, Marshal McLachlan. Age 26.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:56.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Height, 179 cm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:57.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He has never been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He returned to his homeland once eight years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but he came back here to Japan\Nto avoid military service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:08.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An ambassador's son? Maybe we can't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:12.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will negotiate with his home\Ncountry to revoke his immunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:14.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is the culprit's current location?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:18.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is heading towards the\NFukuoka area using Loop number 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:22.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That rich kid is driving such a nice car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:27.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From the IR system's picture,\Nit seems a Jerry is riding with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:30.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's a Jerry for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Guide him off the highway when\Nyou think the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then corner him in a blind alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will take clear action from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:41.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:42.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:46.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How nice, his last drive is\Ngoing to be along the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:58.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His idea of buying a robot and customizing\Nit into an ideal girlfriend is so "macho".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.19,0:14:59.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:01.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Macho"? And why are you saying this, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:05.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That sure is an opinion that\Nvalues the female perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:09.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He probably makes her stay at\Nhome to do laundry and cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:11.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I don't think it can cook something fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:16.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think it was possible to achieve\Nthat functionality at that price back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then what does he make her do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't get mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.09,0:15:22.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe he places her somewhere,\Nand gazes at her all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:23.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So he is "macho".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:26.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Like I said before, why are you saying this Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:34.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why would he be attached to an\Nold piece of junk robot anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:38.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are always guys who\Ncan't get over the nostalgia
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:41.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,of old devices that can't\Nbe bought with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He might get along well with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:50.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You still use this old car, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:54.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In my case, it's purely love of the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:02.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:06.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why are you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:08.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because I am looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:11.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your face looks best from the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:13.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is very like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aren't there a lot of people who\Nare more beautiful than me though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:23.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't get along with them well\Nand it makes me feel miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:27.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:29.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm afraid, but I got used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:33.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you say something nice to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:35.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you believe in the existence of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:43.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I only believe in kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.93,0:16:48.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it. It's under construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I won't let it end the same way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:56.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like he got off the\Nhighway just as we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please head him off now Major, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:05.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So she overrode the GPS and\Ncreated a fake traffic jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:09.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't it fun to work under a competent captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:09.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:12.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Guidance complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:15.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have to thank the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:18.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now we have to wait for the old monkey man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:33.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:36.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:40.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We succeeded in getting his immunity revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:41.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:44.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's an ambassador's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:46.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's try not to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll try to finish it off by just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:56.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was better at negotiating\Nthan at fighting and using guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:15.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:19.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He can't run away quickly with a Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:36.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Marshall McLachlan,\Nson of the Canadian ambassador Harvard McLachlan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can't arrest me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your immunity was revoked by\Nyour home country a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:45.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:48.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, so it's not possible then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:18:58.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:18:59.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We just want to be together.\NDon't interfere with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:04.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:11.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Jerry, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:12.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you go insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:16.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I'm sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.31,0:19:22.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, no, I did go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:28.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to love you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who called that a piece of junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:33.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She talks more than the ones at Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:41.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.55,0:19:44.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I really loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:49.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:06.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That sure was an incomprehensible case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:07.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:10.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought it was a case that\Nwas very easy to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:16.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In the end, it was proven that it had\Nnothing to do with the case at the Capitol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.31,0:20:19.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How do you perceive this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:25.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A threat against the manufacturer by a\Nyoung mecha-maniac who felt nostalgic for old robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:32.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it's ironic that this case was the clincher\Nto cease production of the spare parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:40.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe he wanted to make his\Nandroid the only woman to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:46.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So you're saying that he destroyed the\Nrest of the Jerrys because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:51.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His motive was simple although\Nthe method he used was clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:55.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's unusual, you're being sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:58.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if that was the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he put a protection code on his Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:05.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So why did his Jerry become insane in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No other viruses were found on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.67,0:21:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you saying that the Jerry helped the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:18.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Jerrys are robots with no Ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:24.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I was little,\NI remember crushing an important doll
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:27.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and crying because I couldn't\Nuse my cyborg body well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:33.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But you're one of the world's\Nbest cyborg body users now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:44.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you watching old movies again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,20th century videos are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:52.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you go insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I'm sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, no, I did go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:58.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to love you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:01.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing? It was about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:03.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you go insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.85,0:22:06.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I'm sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:08.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, no, I did go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:10.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to love you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.07,0:22:12.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So this was the origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.77,0:22:17.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sadness is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:18.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would choose nothing instead of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:24.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you believe in the existence of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:26.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I only believe in kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.57,0:22:29.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you go insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:32.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I'm sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, no, I did go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:36.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to love you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:42.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The words that the Jerry said last aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:47.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, there is another line after this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:50.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, there isn’t. It's a perfect un-cut version.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But when you live in flower just a mountain bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
